WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.808 --> 00:00:05.831
Hello! [s@Hello!

2
00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:18.418
Who are you?

3
00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:21.719
I'm a gecko.

4
00:00:23.721 --> 00:00:25.822
Geckos are colorful lizards.

5
00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:29.664
Where do you live?

6
00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:34.233
Geckos live all over the world.

7
00:00:35.554 --> 00:00:38.235
We like rain forests and deserts.

8
00:00:40.036 --> 00:00:43.177
But some geckos live in cold places.

9
00:00:45.618 --> 00:00:46.659
What do you eat?

10
00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:50.540
Geckos eat lots of insects.

11
00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:54.822
We also like fruit and flower nectar.

12
00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.664
Your tail is cool!

13
00:01:00.532 --> 00:01:02.253
Our tails help us climb.

14
00:01:04.374 --> 00:01:06.615
And they protect us from enemies.

15
00:01:09.316 --> 00:01:11.237
How do your tails protect you?

16
00:01:12.897 --> 00:01:15.458
Sometimes enemies grab our tails.

17
00:01:17.459 --> 00:01:19.840
We break off our tails to escape.

18
00:01:21.421 --> 00:01:22.861
They grow back quickly.

19
00:01:25.962 --> 00:01:27.663
Do geckos make sounds?

20
00:01:29.124 --> 00:01:31.377
Yes. Many lizards hiss.

21
00:01:32.818 --> 00:01:35.639
But geckos also click and chirp.

22
00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.641
We can even bark!

23
00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:44.424
You have cute little toes!

24
00:01:45.945 --> 00:01:47.686
We have pads on our toes.

25
00:01:49.107 --> 00:01:50.368
The pads are sticky.

26
00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:57.292
That helps us climb—and stick to things.

27
00:02:01.795 --> 00:02:03.619
I see a tasty cricket.

28
00:02:04.822 --> 00:02:05.704
See you later.

29
00:02:07.889 --> 00:02:08.410
Good-bye,
